T:Crown Him With Many Crowns
T:DIADEMATA
C:Music: George J. Elvey, 1868 · Words: Verses 1, 4, 5, 6 & 9: Matthew Bridges, The Passion of Jesus, 1852. verses 2 & 3: Godfrey Thring, Hymns and Sacred Lyrics, 1874
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Appendix to Hymns Ancient and Modern", 1869 Hymn 318. Ed. William H. Monk. Unknown if the arrangement is Elvey's or Monk's.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/diademata_elvey): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
